message:
Added eTPM.nii in hmri_defaults

Can be retrieved calling:
hmri_get_defaults('TPM');

Merge branch 'master' into dev

This brings the new character class behaviour (much less escaping;
careful ordering) to dev branch from master.

cmake: honor OPENSPACE_HAVE_TESTS at more places

- don't build the codegen unit tests if the OpenSpace unit tests are
  disabled;
- propagate the value of this option to Ghoul's corresponding option,
  unless Ghoul's option value has been forced;
- same for SGCT.

Renaming path tokens
  - ${BASE_PATH} -> ${BASE}
  - ${OPENSPACE_DATA} -> ${DATA}
  - Make use of new token ${WEB}
Enable Phobos and Deimos on default
Remove unused cdflist file

cmake: honor OPENSPACE_HAVE_TESTS at more places (#3503)

- Don't build the codegen unit tests if the OpenSpace unit tests are
  disabled;
- Dropagate the value of this option to Ghoul's corresponding option,
  unless Ghoul's option value has been forced;

Arc length reparameterization by computing sample pairs

Curve parameter (u) samples are computed from arc length values using a combination of Newton's method and bisection. Approximated curve parameter is comuted using a linear fit of the samples (OBS! Should be improved to a higher order later
)

Lets wave GUI. Fixed error when updating the selected files

letswave_gui.m: line:565
for i=length(old_filelist);
should be
for i=1:length(old_filelist);

deduplication refactored for tests;
forgotten preliminary deduplication added;
overkill sortings to better define behavior

overlap of path with conjugate and with itself processed with all others;
overlaps extended to path start if needed;
fixes and improvements

-- two new options:
  -- discard_only_singletons always counts non-singleton cluster centers for read correction;
  -- regular_threshold_for_correction uses a (more relaxed) threshold for read correction.

GapDescription moved to separate header;
temporary? dependency solution via forward declarations;
slight refactoring

cosmetics;
removal of some unnecessary and error-prone iteration_cnt arguments (incl. related micro bugfix);
unnecessary counter in rna simplification removed

increased verbosity of weight counters;
utils::join for easy collection printing;
cleanup

OverlapFindingHelper fixed to properly work with any paths (not only from PathContainer);
try_extend option fixed based on max_diff to ensure consistency;
CommonPrefix behavior with nonzero max_diff fixed

sequence modifying wrapper and read corrector revived;
ReadStatistics usage in splitters temporarily restored;
BlackEdgesStat returned

observable graph fix; logger config change; new err. connection removal fix

fix in handler call order;

fixes in new erroneous connections removal;

logger config slightly changed

big refactoring of graph hierarchy;

fixes made by Anton spreaded to non-conjugate graph;

code duplication reduced significantly
